OL,3,GNEWSAStudent on trial searched 'what
OL,4,Adoes corpse look like'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university student who ambushed and
OL,7,Fstabbed his housemate to death searched
OL,8,F'what does corpse look like' on his
OL,9,Fphone, a court has heard.
OL,11,FZack Coughlan, 23, stabbed Jamie
OL,12,FCollins 30 times in the garden of their
OL,13,Fhome in Filton, near Bristol, on 8
OL,14,FApril in what prosecutors called a
OL,15,F"carefully planned and cold-blooded
OL,16,Fexecution".
OL,18,FHis trial at Bristol Crown Court heard
OL,19,FCoughlan admits responsibility for the
OL,20,Fattack but said he lost self control
OL,21,Fbecause he feared for his life. He
OL,22,Fdenies murder.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
