OL,3,GNEWSAStudent on trial searched 'what
OL,4,Adoes corpse look like'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury heard search terms on his
OL,7,Fphone were made at unknown times which
OL,8,Fincluded "defending yourself with
OL,9,Flethal force against an acid attack
OL,10,Flawful" and ''difference between
OL,11,Frevenge and vengeance".
